@startuml services-families
' Zoom level 0: four families of service, each answering one question an architect asks.
' Level 1 is services-map.puml (the six services), level 2 is services-architecture.puml.
!include palette.iuml
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F2F7F9
  BorderColor #757579
}
skinparam defaultFontSize 22

rectangle "**1  Find**\n\nWho offers what,\nand which codes\ndo we agree on?" as F
rectangle "**2  Do**\n\nHow is work requested,\ntracked and scheduled?" as D
rectangle "**3  Connect**\n\nHow does the legacy\nestate join in?" as C
rectangle "**4  Prove**\n\nHow do I know\nit works?" as P
F -[hidden]right- D
D -[hidden]right- C
C -[hidden]right- P
@enduml
